  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>全新的Waystones纹理</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">该纹理包将优化<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones模组。</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>！资源包不会更改碰撞箱！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">！全新更新！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">修改前 - 修改后</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860903/description_b2f5ef29-a818-4ecb-abd4-9b415f4a3da4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"673\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860903/description_9ca4e4a8-e456-4e6d-a875-ccbcaa4a63b9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"516\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2024/370/17671269_l.webp\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2021/370/15194256_l.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"417\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2023/370/16401062_l.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"417\"></strong></p>",
